<title>USA: Burlington to buy back 475,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Burlington to buy back 475,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, N.C. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textile company Burlington Industries Inc said on Monday it would repurchase about 475,000 shares of common stock, to contribute to its Employee Stock Ownership Plan.</p>
<p>Purchases would be made in the open market or in privately negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1600</p>
</text>
